{
  "esm": "2.1.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "str_pairsum_lin",
    "description": "Scalar atom of the CICE stress-combination algebra (ice_dyn_evp.F90:1687-1696, the str12* edge transports, and F90:1697-1700, the strp_tmp/strm_tmp pair sums): lin = c*metric*(p333*(a1 + a2) + p166*(a3 + a4)). The str12 terms bind a1/a2 = the two corners of one side pair and a3/a4 = the other side pair with c = p5 and metric = dxT (str12ew, F90:1687-1688) or dyT (str12ns, F90:1691-1692); the strp_tmp/strm_tmp terms bind a1/a2 = the north pair and a3/a4 = the south pair with c = p25 and metric = dyT (F90:1697-1698) or dxT (F90:1701-1702). Pure combination algebra: no faq, no index sets of its own.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": ["esd:stencil", "family:cice_bgrid", "grid:cice_bgrid", "op:stress"],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Hunke, E. C., et al. (2023). CICE v6.3.22 documentation and user's guide (LA-UR-23-31851), the stress() corner combinations."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_templates": {
    "str_pairsum_lin": {
      "params": ["a1", "a2", "a3", "a4", "c", "metric"],
      "body": {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
          "c",
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "metric",
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  { "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "/", "args": [1, 3] }, { "op": "+", "args": ["a1", "a2"] }] },
                  { "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "/", "args": [1, 6] }, { "op": "+", "args": ["a3", "a4"] }] }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
